    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01228",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我之所以特地把这个稿子委托给你，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The reason I went out of my way to entrust this manuscript to you",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
