    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01228",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "是因为我深信你比任何人都更了解我",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "is that I firmly believe you understand me better than anyone else",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01228",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "（只要揭掉我这张城里人的“外皮”）。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "once you peel away this urban person's outer skin of mine.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
